insert into public.playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind)
select 've-supermarket-guide', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $pb$BUILD RECORD, 2026-11-01 (Logan). Everything built for the Supermarket Guide, where it lives, what is live, and what comes next. Full detail: CLAUDE.md in lesaruss/vegansexplore-com, section "The Supermarket Guide and its sponsorship". All of it is on main (last commit f6ac05d); the Guide is built but NOT launched (noindex, catalog card Coming soon).

1. ENGINE. Runs on the venue Guides' engine, edge function ve-venues (GUIDES supermarket-guide, kind supermarket). A store is a ve_venues row of kind supermarket with chain_listing_id; departments are spots (Refrigerated, Frozen, Pantry, Snacks); the 15 Vegan sections are items, each "Aisle not mapped yet" until a member maps it (photo, in-store location check, review, points, first-to-confirm bounties). ve_supermarket_seed_store(venue) gives a new store the template. Migration 20261101_supermarket_guide.sql.
2. FREE WHILE SPONSORED. ve_supermarket_sponsors (title | partner | spotlight; pending | active | ended) and its trigger run ve_supermarket_guide_sync(): ve_guides.access_rule of supermarket-guide is free while a Title or Partner sponsorship is active, else points ($11 or 1,100). Sponsors are added by hand for now.
3. STORES. From Google Places: 248 Publix (South Florida 245, Central Florida 3) and North Florida 121. Import script scripts/supabase-once/supermarket-import.ts (one chapter a run, parts, retries; key placeholder only). Google allows 500 text searches a day for the whole project; Central Florida's rest waits on quota. Free example: Publix at Brickell Village (publix-miami-cjalb8).
4. THE PAGE. guides/supermarket-guide.html and guide-scripts/supermarket-guide.js (the Airport Guide's layout, Pascal on the right in the Vegans Explore tee, lines as text). Tabs: Overview, Stores (supermarket, chapter, search, Near me, 24 at a time), one store per view, My list (ticks in localStorage sg_ticks), Produce, Help keep it right, Get access. Department icons (DEPT_ICON, rounded squares) and section photos (SEC_IMG, public/guides/supermarket/<key>.jpg, illustrative, no labels; a member's accepted photo replaces it).
5. STORE LAYOUT. Three-fourths and one-fourth: departments two across (one under 1100 px) beside the ad rail (ve-ad-rail.js page /guides/supermarket-guide: ve-supermarket-guide-1 the Dairy Guide house ad, -2 Humble Cabbage's still; migration 20261101_supermarket_guide_ad_rail.sql). A sponsor takes a slot by linking its campaign.
6. SECTION PAGES. #/store/<slug>/s/<item>: photo, the aisle as members found it, Tell us the aisle, Products to look for (Dairy Guide ve_products by product_type via SEC_PRODUCTS; Seen at <chain> first, from ve_product_stores) and Brands that make it (Directory Food Brands by product_kinds). Vegan cheese shows 35 (2 Seen at Publix). Tofu and tempeh, hummus and dips have none yet and say so.
7. ON LISTINGS. Every grocery chain's listing has Find a store (?tab=stores, ve-venues stores) when we hold its stores.
8. CATALOG AND PITCH. Coming soon card (members, Pascal, banner public/guides/supermarket-guide.jpg?v=2). Sponsor pitch /business/supermarkets (guided view, noindex): the Guide with a live store, three tiers, Q1 2027 campaign, 2027 story as plans, Front Row Start, Email our team.
9. STORE CLOTHING RULE. Guides wear only store items (Vegans Explore tee); Pascal's Supermarket, Meal Prep and Meat Alternatives banners redone. The model garbles the small EXPLORE: paste the real mark from nutrition-guide.jpg.

OPEN REQUEST (Sean, 2026-11-01, not built yet): "For Vegan Cheese and other categories, drill down further so people can search for the different types of cheeses. Keep the frames the same size, 3 is good. The rest can be a scroll." Plan: on a section page, type chips (cheese: shreds, slices, blocks, cream cheese, parmesan, spreads; milk: oat, almond, soy, coconut; and so on per section) plus a search box over the products; each product list box shows three rows at a fixed height and scrolls inside for the rest; the same on Brands that make it.

STILL OPEN, ON SEAN'S WORD. Launch (ve_guides row published, noindex off, card out of Coming soon). Central Florida Publix import when quota allows. Not built: weekly specials, CPG spotlights in shopping lists, sponsor checkout, other chains' stores (Whole Foods, Sprouts next).$pb$, 'text', 'decision'
where not exists (select 1 from public.playbook_records where slug = 've-supermarket-guide' and body like 'BUILD RECORD, 2026-11-01%');
